{"id": 14453, "group": "campus-vnit-nagpur-placements", "sent_at": "2026-10-27T15:26:46.016658+00:00", "text": "Tredence OA generally focuses on DSA, problem-solving, and basic programming concepts. For coding preparation, I would recommend revising arrays, strings, hashing, sorting, binary search, two pointers, sliding window, recursion, and basic dynamic programming. Also, practise time and space complexity analysis and SQL queries, as these may be relevant depending on the role. LeetCode Easy–Medium problems are a good starting point. If you have limited time, focus on frequently asked coding patterns and practise solving problems within a time limit. All the best to everyone preparing for the OA!", "author_tag": "VNIT", "reply_to": {"id": 13740, "text": "does anyone have tredence oa questions can you please share", "author_tag": "IIIT"}, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
